ink: &lt;a class="link" href="https://www.pixiv.net/artworks/70462748" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&#10; &gt;氷のプリンセス&lt;/a&gt;, Princess of Ice! Great!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="introduction"&gt;Introduction&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;You may find some files sitting in my blog posts, and here is a list of these files. You can check and download these mentioned contents here.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;These files are sorted as how they appear in the posts. Currently they are mainly something used or created by myself.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Friends</title><link>https://blog.a-moment.top/en/page/friends/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.a-moment.top/en/page/friends/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://blog.a-moment.top/images/%E8%8A%B1%E3%81%A8%E6%B0%B4%E9%A3%B4%E3%80%81%E6%9C%80%E7%B5%82%E9%9B%BB%E8%BB%8A.png" alt="Featured image of post Friends" /&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Picture by: &lt;a class="link" href="https://www.pixiv.net/en/users/96825901" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&#10; &gt;白ゆき&lt;/a&gt;, titled with &lt;a class="link" href="https://www.pixiv.net/en/artworks/132033239" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&#10; &gt;花と水飴、最終電車&lt;/a&gt;. Really beautiful illustrations~ There are a lot of &amp;ldquo;song-illustrations&amp;rdquo; of n-buna&amp;rsquo;s song, and this should be one of them I guess.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Then, why not have a listen to the title track of this album?&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#13;&#10;&lt;link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/aplayer/dist/APlayer.min.css"&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;style type="text/css"&gt;&#13;&#10;[data-scheme="dark"] .aplayer {&#13;&#10; background: var(--card-background);&#13;&#10; border: 1px solid var(--card-separator-color);&#13;&#10;}&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;[data-scheme="dark"] .aplayer.aplayer-withlist .aplayer-info {&#13;&#10; border-bottom-color: var(--card-separator-color);&#13;&#10;}&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;[data-scheme="dark"] .aplayer