uto="https://music.163.com/#/song?id=33367346" theme="#2980b9" loop="none"&gt;&lt;/meting-js&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to exchange links with me~ You can send your message to &lt;a class="link" href="mailto:amoment096@gmail.com" &gt;my mailbox&lt;/a&gt;, or you can use the comment system under this page.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Links</title><link>https://blog.a-moment.top/en/page/links/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.a-moment.top/en/page/links/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://blog.a-moment.top/images/star-river.png" alt="Featured image of post Links" /&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Theoretically, this page should be updated from time to time. Hope that I remember some links are put here.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This image is a screenshot from ED of &lt;strong&gt;BanG Dream! Ave Mujica&lt;/strong&gt;, and the selected song/image are inspired by &lt;a class="link" href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1DrNJe5ESg/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&#10; &gt;【AI若叶睦】star river（原曲:感情の摩天楼 ～ Cosmic Mind）&lt;/a&gt;, a fine tuned AI cover.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Search</title><link>https://blog.a-moment.top/en/page/search/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.a-moment.top/en/page/search/</guid><description/></item></channel></rss>